[{"id":"955586756325199872","date":1516664611000,"rawContent":"Germaine Greer has challenged #MeToo campaign. Can the media please stop referring to Greer as \"Australia's most famous feminist\"? We exiled her from the coven years ago.  https:\/\/t.co\/g921cYdliO via @smh","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"955727772340576257","date":1516698232000,"rawContent":"The ABC has announced that alleged sexual harasser Charles Waterstreet will be on the Q&amp;A #MeToo special. They invited me 2 sit in the audience. Women do not need men to explain sexual harassment to us. Men should sit in audience &amp; listen as women explain it. Get me on the Panel!","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"955793713900367872","date":1516713953000,"rawContent":"@SandiHLogan @ABCTV The fact that any media org will continue to platform him is concerning. But the fact that he has the audacity to take up so much space in a limited 5 person panel on #MeToo is shocking. Seriously ABC? I'm a sexual assault survivor, but you're prioritizing his voice over mine?","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964068705565949953","date":1518686865000,"rawContent":"Looking forward to hearing from @catharinelumby  on the #MeToo special hosted by @QandA","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964079838213562369","date":1518689519000,"rawContent":"\"If #metoo is going to have a lasting impact we need to address gender equality from cradle to grave\" @JoshBorenstein calling it like it is on @qanda","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964080158503157760","date":1518689596000,"rawContent":"@catharinelumby says sex ed shouldn't just focus on biology.... it needs to address communication and consent. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964081409060102144","date":1518689894000,"rawContent":"\"Fault and responsibility are not the same thing.\" #qanda  #Metoo","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964082490200571904","date":1518690152000,"rawContent":"OK #qanda you've spent enough time talking about how to \"make men comfortable\" in the \"debate\". Now can we talk about how to make women safe in their LIVES? #metoo @QandA","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964083578224091137","date":1518690411000,"rawContent":"@QandA the onus is not on the person being harassed to micromanage, police or manage up their harasser. The onus is on the harasser to STOP. #MeToo #qanda","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"964085290045341697","date":1518690819000,"rawContent":"#Metoo #QandA @QandA \"By the time a woman comes to see me about a sexual harassment the 1st thing I'm prepared for is that her health will be severly compromised\"\" @JoshBornstein nailing it.","media":null,"username":"ninafunnell","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfB